=BB=8Bnhsauchuy=E1=BB=83nch=E1=BA=BF-1.USERSTORY">1. USER STORY</h3>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"7">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"7" data-uuid=3D"309cf11a-fe2a-4505-90=
48-525b10dfd069"><strong>L=C3=A0 m=E1=BB=99t (As a):</strong><span>&nbsp;</=
span>MC Nguy=C3=AAn li=E1=BB=87u t=E1=BA=A1i Kho NL</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"8" data-uuid=3D"f6ce2f7f-538c-4022-bd=
c4-4bc2e920bdc7"><strong>T=C3=B4i mu=E1=BB=91n (I want):</strong><span>&nbs=
p;</span>th=E1=BB=B1c hi=E1=BB=87n =C4=91o ph=E1=BB=95 XRF, khai b=C3=A1o k=
h=E1=BB=91i l=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3ng th=E1=BB=B1c nh=E1=BA=ADn cho nguy=C3=AAn li=
=E1=BB=87u sau khi chuy=E1=BB=83n ch=E1=BA=BF, sau =C4=91=C3=B3 =C4=91=C6=
=B0a ra quy=E1=BA=BFt =C4=91=E1=BB=8Bnh Nh=E1=BA=ADp kho ho=E1=BA=B7c C=E1=
=BA=A5p th=E1=BA=B3ng cho Y=C3=AAu c=E1=BA=A7u c=E1=BA=A5p NL =C4=91ang ch=
=E1=BB=9D.</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"9" data-uuid=3D"af710cc6-ff6d-4d54-bd=
b1-267e5d9ecb04"><strong>=C4=90=E1=BB=83 (So that):</strong><span>&nbsp;</s=
pan>quy tr=C3=ACnh nh=E1=BA=ADn th=C3=A0nh ph=E1=BA=A9m sau ch=E1=BA=BF =C4=
=91=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3c qu=E1=BA=A3n l=C3=BD ch=E1=BA=B7t ch=E1=BA=BD nh=C6=B0 =
m=E1=BB=99t phi=E1=BA=BFu x=E1=BB=AD, =C4=91=E1=BB=93ng th=E1=BB=9Di =C4=91=
=E1=BA=A3m b=E1=BA=A3o linh ho=E1=BA=A1t trong v=E1=BA=ADn h=C3=A0nh (c=E1=
=BA=A5p li=E1=BB=81n n=E1=BA=BFu c=C3=B3 Order ch=E1=BB=9D).</li>
</ul>
<hr class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"11">
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"13" id=3D"id-=E2=9C=85CS1.E=
